From 95d6e6164237d866802ac8aa87d1f8e943b5d865 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiras Rahman U <shirasra@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 14:13:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] This patch ports CcspPandM to the SDX platform by adding _PLATFORM_SDX_ compile guards across device info, user management, and ethernet APIs. It also disables HAL-dependent features (MACsec, SNMPv3, CMTS MAC, Ethernet switch stats) that are not yet available or required on this platform using #if 0 blocks.

Signed-off-by: Shiras Rahman U <shirasra@qti.qualcomm.com>

---
 .../TR-181/board_sbapi/cosa_deviceinfo_apis.c    |  7 +++++--
 .../TR-181/board_sbapi/cosa_ethernet_apis.c      |  3 +++
 source-arm/TR-181/board_sbapi/cosa_users_apis.c  |  4 ++--
 .../middle_layer_src/cosa_deviceinfo_dml.c       | 16 ++++++++++++----
 .../middle_layer_src/cosa_users_internal.c       |  3 ++-
 .../cosa_x_rdkcentral_com_xpc_internal.c         |  7 +++++--
 6 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

